     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>You only need to check numbers up to the square root of 5,067,322, which is approximately 2251.071301.</p>\n<p>Step 1: Use the known rules of divisibility.</p>\n<p>2: The last digit is even.</p>\n<p>The last digit is even.</p>\n<p>5,067,322 = 2 × 2,533,661</p>\n<p>The conclusion is that 5,067,322 is a composite number.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "5,067,322 is a composite number."
    }
   ],
